# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/tailscale/fixtures/connected
# The choices beyond being on the tailnet are on a page of their own, each
# off until the owner turns it on. A switch that is off says only its name;
# what one costs is said once it is on.
wait-for Connected
expect Runs while Cobalt is open.
tap Options
wait-for Stay connected outside Cobalt
expect-missing Stops when you leave Cobalt.
expect Offer as an exit node
expect Share this network
expect-missing battery
expect-missing admin console
clean
shot tailscale-options
tap-id stay
wait-for Uses more battery.
expect only while the reader is awake
expect After a restart, open Cobalt once to connect again.
clean
shot tailscale-staying
# The first screen says which of the two it is doing.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Stays connected after you leave Cobalt.
expect-missing Runs while Cobalt is open.
